From: Leonardo Grasso <me@leonardograsso.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:16:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mermaid-text): draw a simple top-down fan-out as one
 trunk

Each edge of a fan-out was routed on its own, so the edges shared the row under the source and turned down at different points, crossing each other. A simple TD fan-out (no subgraphs, rectangle or cylinder nodes, unlabelled same-style edges to distinct targets on one row, no other edge into them) is now drawn as one trunk under the source, a bar and a drop into each target, when that corridor is clear of node boxes and text and does not touch an unrelated node. Everything else routes as before.
